{"id":"wb-4-131","name":"蔚州玉皇阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"蔚州玉皇阁","text":"蔚州玉皇阁，又称靖边楼，是明代洪武年间修扩建蔚州城时修建的城防设施，后也做玉皇阁用。蔚州玉皇阁现位于中华人民共和国河北省张家口市蔚县北城墙上，为以二层楼阁——玉皇阁大殿为主体建筑的建筑群。蔚州玉皇阁建成后多次修缮，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%94%9A%E5%B7%9E%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E9%98%81","revisionId":91604271,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91604271","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/910ca8dfd882a70eb0e56fb5.jpg","title":"蔚州玉皇阁前院.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%94%9A%E5%B7%9E%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E9%98%81%E5%89%8D%E9%99%A2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/%E8%94%9A%E5%B7%9E%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E9%98%81%E5%89%8D%E9%99%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​蔚州玉皇阁前院","width":320,"height":284}}